      "name": "USEFUL FOODS AND DRINKS",
      "slug": "useful-foods-and-drinks",
      "teaser": "All the food/drink items are changed. Better and Handy.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/304.png",
      "downloads": 12723,
      "favourites_count": 9,
      "description": "<h1>USEFUL FOODS AND DRINKS</h1>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Updated the mod to SPT v4.0.6</strong></p>\n<p><em>All the food/drink items are changed</em></p>\n<p><em>Installation</em>\ncopy the “SPT” folder into your “SPT Root folder”</p>\n<p><strong>Updated items:</strong></p>\n<p>Original Default values can be found in original.json</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All food and drink items found in the wiki “Tarkov Wiki Foods and Drinks”.</li>\n<li>Increased energy and decreased hydration penalty for all the items.</li>\n<li>Animation time is not changed.</li>\n<li>Each items properties can be modified individually in the config.json file.</li>\n<li>Everything is configurable. Please refer the config files inside config folder. If you need clarification reach me in the comment section.</li>\n<li>Added maxResource for Provision items. Items can be used multiple times. Configuration added.</li>\n</ul>\n",
